{"id":593,"slug":"veronika-voss","title":"Veronika Voss","year":1982,"country":"West Germany","duration":104,"spine":205,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/593-veronika-voss","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/a2ae0ebf50af9b05c8b3b3d280ff6366/OuXLNXn2wzJkaHMdreItHpbYZUOFYr_large.jpg","description":"\nA once-beloved Third Reich–era starlet, Veronika Voss (Rosel Zech) lives in obscurity in postwar Munich. Struggling for survival and haunted by past glories, she encounters sportswriter Robert Krohn (Hilmar Thate) in a rain-swept park and intrigues him with her mysterious beauty. As their unlikely relationship develops, Robert comes to discover the dark secrets that brought about the decline of Veronika’s career. Based on the true story of a World War II Ufa star, Rainer Werner Fassbinder’s Veronika Voss is wicked satire disguised as a 1950s melodrama. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Rainer Werner Fassbinder","slug":"rainer-werner-fassbinder"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Rosel Zech","role":"Veronika Voss","slug":"rosel-zech"},{"actor":"Hilmar Thate","role":"Robert Krohn","slug":"hilmar-thate"},{"actor":"Cornelia Froboess","role":"Henriette","slug":"cornelia-froboess"},{"actor":"Annemarie Düringer","role":"Dr. Marianne Katz","slug":"annemarie-duringer"},{"actor":"Doris Schade","role":"Josefa","slug":"doris-schade"},{"actor":"Erik Schumann","role":"Dr. Edel","slug":"erik-schumann"},{"actor":"Peter Berling","role":"Film producer","slug":"peter-berling"},{"actor":"Günther Kaufmann","role":"GI","slug":"gunther-kaufmann-2"},{"actor":"Sonja Neudorfer","role":"Saleswoman","slug":"sonja-neudorfer"},{"actor":"Lilo Pempeit","role":"Shop owner","slug":"lilo-pempeit"},{"actor":"Volker Spengler","role":"Film director no. 1","slug":"volker-spengler"},{"actor":"Herbert Steinmetz","role":"Gardener","slug":"herbert-steinmetz"},{"actor":"Elisabeth Volkmann","role":"Grete","slug":"elisabeth-volkmann"},{"actor":"Hans Wyprächtiger","role":"Editor-in-chief"